body: "SYMPTOM: missing credentials, missing --project/--jql, and Jira fetch failures all returned { success:false, error } from run(), which the CLI treats as a successful command -> exit code 0. A CI/script chaining on exit status proceeds as if the sync succeeded.\n\nREPRO: unset JIRA_BASE_URL JIRA_API_TOKEN JIRA_EMAIL; pm jira sync --project PROJ >/dev/null 2>&1; echo $? -> 0 (before fix).\n\nOBSERVED vs EXPECTED: observed exit 0 on failure; expected non-zero.\n\nFIX: replaced the three `return { success:false, ... }` paths with `throw new Error(...)`. Verified live after fix: no-creds=1, no-project=1, fetch-failure=1."
